{
  "name": "Logan",
  "description": "Dry polyphonic MIDI port of Logan from joel / ebmtranceboy's altamax (https://ide.csound.com/editor/pXPRc5Y1vALtxqgszdhI). Four per-instance controls: Timbre, Evolution, Release, Level. Velocity controls output gain only. 1 ms MIDI attack/decay, full sustain; no source mixer effects. Audio-rate phasors and mirror/limit formulas preserve the alternating cubic phase-shaping network. Timbre sets the initial shape; it sweeps to 0.03 over Evolution seconds.",
